  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting orphans in the Republic of Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Covering the basic needs of 800 orphans and acquiring vocational skills for 150 orphans.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enrolling 800 orphans in orphanages to cover their basic needs, including housing, education, healthcare, psychological support, and food. In addition, 150 orphans over the age of 15 are enrolled in educational programs for vocational professions.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to cover the basic needs of orphans in the Republic of Nigeria and provide educational programs for economic empowerment for a number of orphans over the age of 15.</narrative>
  </description>
